  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder and weighted fusion achieves 0.54 accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with a more complex imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping the RNA encoder and fusion method consistent. This clarifies whether advanced image encoders improve performance, building on the current best setup. The expected cost is higher (approx 1.2 GPU hours) but justified by the potential impact of the image encoder choice."
